# The servers' images (rust/server/geo/Dockerfile, rust/server/api/Dockerfile)
# build from the repository's root, the one directory holding both trees they
# copy: rust/ and xpute's Cargo workspace, whose crates it links by path. Docker
# reads this file only at the context's root, so it lives here, and lets in
# those two trees alone.

*
!rust
!xpute/Cargo.toml
!xpute/kit/rust
!xpute/link/rust
!xpute/guest/rust
!xpute/native/host
!xpute/gpu/link/rust
!xpute/gpu/guest/rust
!xpute/gpu/native/host
!xpute/gpu/gen-targets
!xpute/gen
!xpute/gen-targets
!xpute/dev/golden/rust
!xpute/dev/tool
**/target
**/.env
